{"id":"dfc399e1f596d128","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTable.md","title":"MTable","display":"MTable","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MTable","parameters":["w","r","v","s"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MTable"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>s</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>s</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MTable w r v s)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nonempty w)\n  (and\n    (@ RelationOn w r)\n    (and\n      (@ WorldVal w v)\n      (and\n        (forall q (implies (in q s) (exists a (exists x (and (@ Pair a x q) (and (@ FmM a) (in x w)))))))\n        (and\n          (forall n\n            (forall a\n              (forall x\n                (implies\n                  (and (@ Nat n) (and (@ PAtom n a) (in x w)))\n                  (iff (@ Edge s a x) (exists u (and (@ App v n u) (in x u))))))))\n          (and\n            (forall a (forall x (implies (and (@ PBot a) (in x w)) (not (@ Edge s a x)))))\n            (and\n              (forall a\n                (forall b\n                  (forall x\n                    (implies (and (@ FmM a) (and (@ PNeg a b) (in x w))) (iff (@ Edge s b x) (not (@ Edge s a x)))))))\n              (and\n                (forall a\n                  (forall b\n                    (forall c\n                      (forall x\n                        (implies\n                          (and (@ FmM a) (and (@ FmM b) (and (@ PImp a b c) (in x w))))\n                          (iff (@ Edge s c x) (implies (@ Edge s a x) (@ Edge s b x))))))))\n                (forall a\n                  (forall b\n                    (forall x\n                      (implies\n                        (and (@ FmM a) (and (@ PBox a b) (in x w)))\n                        (iff (@ Edge s b x) (forall y (implies (in y w) (implies (@ Edge r x y) (@ Edge s a y)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"852442b30ad8fc4e\" href=\"?note=852442b30ad8fc4e\" title=\"ZFC_FmM\">FmM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d00664d192427d28\" href=\"?note=d00664d192427d28\" title=\"ZFC_PBox\">PBox</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" href=\"?note=cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" title=\"ZFC_RelationOn\">RelationOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"beeed89974e85c6b\" href=\"?note=beeed89974e85c6b\" title=\"ZFC_WorldVal\">WorldVal</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MTable w r v s)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmM","status":"resolved","id":"852442b30ad8fc4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot